  "body": "Just moments from the shore, 4/760 Beach Road is a solid brick-and-tile unit offering easy, low-maintenance living in a sought-after seaside location.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a short stroll to Browns Bay Beach and the vibrant village with cafes, shops, and local amenities. Close to public transport and in excellent school zones.\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers, downsizers, or investors.\r\nAffordable. Solid. Coastal.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n*\tTwo light-filled bedrooms\r\n*\tOpen-plan living and dining\r\n*\tNew kitchen with good storage\r\n*\tRenovated bathroom + separate laundry\r\n*\tEasy-care section\r\n*\tSingle garage with off-street parking\r\n*\tTwo sheds\r\n\r\nALL AGENTS WELCOME. \r\n\r\nTo download the property files please visit:- https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/2MSM",
